      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the 1950s, Newkirk served as an unloading station for the construction of Conchas Dam, helping to control flooding on the Canadian River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
